menu "SynthDef memory placement"
    config SYNTHDEF_INTERNAL_ADAPTER
        bool "Keep audio control and PCM routines in internal instruction RAM"
        default y
        help
            Avoids flash instruction misses in the small per-block adapter.
            The sound algorithms and PCM rounding remain unchanged.
    config SYNTHDEF_INTERNAL_KERNELS
        bool "Keep admitted-voice rendering kernels in internal instruction RAM"
        default y
        help
            Avoids contention with display code for the flash instruction cache.
            Only linker placement changes; engine source and math stay pinned.
    config SYNTHDEF_INTERNAL_SINE
        bool "Keep the immutable sine lookup table in internal RAM"
        default n
        help
            Uses 32772 bytes of internal RAM to avoid flash data-cache misses
            in the admitted oscillator. No engine code or table bytes change.
endmenu
